    "description": "<p>The Master Privateer's experience as a privateer has hardened them to the realities of battle, granting them the ability to subdue their foes with little difficulty. When a Master Privateer makes a melee attack roll, as a <a href=\"/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a> they can grant themselves a +2 competence bonus on that attack roll. A Master Privateer can do this a number of times per encounter equal to one-half their Class Level (Rounded down).</p>",
